1
00:00:03,292 --> 00:00:10,625
Sheru Bhai: My son wants to build a career in aviation. Find me the best aviation college in India. I am ready to buy one!

2
00:00:15,417 --> 00:00:18,333
Bodyguard: Sir, we have found Global School of Aviation!

3
00:00:19,208 --> 00:00:22,917
Sheru Bhai: Good! Find out how much it costs. I want to buy it!

4
00:00:23,583 --> 00:00:27,208
Bodyguard: Sir, Global School of Aviation has three branches in India!

5
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:33,833
Sheru Bhai: Only three branches? Interesting! Let's investigate further.

6
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:41,583
Bodyguard: Sir! There is something much bigger behind it! Global Flight Handling Services operates across 30+ airports in India!

7
00:00:44,208 --> 00:00:46,917
Sheru Bhai: What?! Thirty-plus airports?

8
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:54,833
Sheru Bhai: I came here to buy an aviation college... but this is much bigger than I imagined!

9
00:00:55,583 --> 00:00:59,000
Bodyguard: Sir, I don't think we can buy this company!

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,417
Sheru Bhai: Then forget buying it. Let's join my son there!

11
00:01:08,292 --> 00:01:11,583
Sheru Bhai: Son, this is where your aviation journey begins!
